WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.380 --> 00:00:04.670
Open Synthetic Reporter and select
Synthetic Reporter DNA.

2
00:00:04.700 --> 00:00:08.450
Press Command K to open the command
palette, type Build report, and

3
00:00:08.480 --> 00:00:13.990
choose that command. Report handoff opens
for the selected source block.

4
00:00:14.020 --> 00:00:16.470
Start by checking the name at the top.

5
00:00:16.500 --> 00:00:20.920
Then review Attachments. This example
includes the selected sequence as

6
00:00:20.950 --> 00:00:27.150
FASTA, a block-summary CSV, a styled
sequence report, and a GenBank file.

7
00:00:27.180 --> 00:00:30.510
The dialog describes what each format
preserves.

8
00:00:30.540 --> 00:00:34.990
Expand Package zip preview to inspect the
files that will be included.

9
00:00:35.020 --> 00:00:39.160
The package brings the report, selected
attachments, and supporting metadata

10
00:00:39.190 --> 00:00:43.675
together in one download. Review the
selection before clicking Download

11
00:00:43.705 --> 00:00:47.490
ZIP. After the download, open Activity in
the Inspector.

12
00:00:47.520 --> 00:00:51.905
Find Report package exported and confirm
that the event is marked completed.
